            -bottom-1 md:-bottom-1 h-[2px]
          "></span><span class="relative z-0">Project</span></span></h2></div><div class="mt-1 sm:mt-0 flex items-center gap-4 flex-shrink-0"></div></div></div><p class="text-text-secondary font-roboto text-sm md:text-lg text-justify line-clamp-4">Ruparel Stardom is an iconic luxury residential development located in Malad West, Mumbai, offering thoughtfully designed 2 and 3 BHK residences within a premium gated community. Spread across approximately 3.7 acres, the project comprises four elegant towers rising up to 49 storeys, featuring spacious homes with private decks and contemporary interiors. Strategically situated off Link Road, the development enjoys excellent connectivity to the Western Express Highway, Malad Metro Station, Malad Railway Station, SV Road, and major business hubs including Mindspace and Goregaon. Residents are surrounded by renowned schools, healthcare centres, shopping destinations, and entertainment hubs. The project features over 40 world-class lifestyle amenities, including a grand clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, landscaped gardens, children&#x27;s play area, indoor games, jogging track, multipurpose hall, sports courts, sky leisure spaces, and advanced multi-tier security, delivering an elevated urban lifestyle.</p></div></section><section id="amenities" class="py-3 md:py-7" data-section="amenities"><div class="flex flex-col "><div class="flex justify-between items-center flex-nowrap mb-4 md:mb-6"><div class="max-w-full w-auto"><h2 class="relative inline-flex flex-wrap items-baseline px-0 text-text-primary font-medium font-plusJakarta text-[18px] md:text-[24px] "><span class="inline-flex flex-wrap items-baseline"><span class="relative inline-block mr-1 md:mb-1"><span class="relative z-0">Amenities</span></span><span class="absolute left-0 w-[32px] md:w-[64px] h-[2px] md:h-1 rounded-t-2xl bg-primary z-0 mt-1 
