xt-text-secondary leading-relaxed break-words [overflow-wrap:anywhere] [word-break:break-word] whitespace-pre-line">Ruparel Stardom comprises multiple residential units designed to cater to different family sizes and preferences.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-xl p-4 md:py-5 md:px-8 gap-4 md:gap-6 shadow-md md:shadow-[1px_1px_7px_rgba(0,0,0,0.21)] transition-all duration-300 w-full min-w-0 overflow-hidden max-w-full bg-gray-50"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left gap-3 min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-lg font-roboto transition-colors flex-1 min-w-0 break-words [overflow-wrap:anywhere] [word-break:break-word] pr-2 text-text-primary">How many bathrooms and balconies are included in each flat?</h3><div class="flex h-5 w-5 md:h-8 md:w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full transition-colors bg-[rgba(154,154,154,0.25)]"><svg class="w-[12px] h-[12px] md:w-6 md:h-6 text-[#505050]" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M5.83329 8.33333L9.99996 12.5L14.1666 8.33333" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 w-full min-w-0 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden min-w-0 w-full"><p class="font-roboto text-xs md:text-base text-text-secondary leading-relaxed break-words [overflow-wrap:anywhere] [word-break:break-word] whitespace-pre-line">Flats in Ruparel Stardom include multiple bathrooms and multiple spacious balconies, providing well-planned space for privacy and leisure.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-xl p-4 md:py-5 md:px-8 gap-4 md:gap-6 shadow-md md:shadow-[1px_1px_7px_rgba(0,0,0,0.21)] transition-all duration-300 w-full min-w-0 overflow-hidden max-w-full bg-gray-50"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left gap-3 min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-lg font-roboto transition-colors flex-1 min-w-0 break-words [overflow-wrap:anywh