l Airport\",\"highlightType\":\"Airport\"},{\"distance\":\"62.5\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"18.98762\",\"longitude\":\"73.0920883\",\"placeName\":\"Navi Mumbai Airport Runway View Point\",\"highlightType\":\"Airport\"},{\"distance\":\"18.9\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.076277\",\"longitude\":\"72.8653997\",\"placeName\":\"Kalina airport\",\"highlightType\":\"Airport\"},{\"distance\":\"2.5\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.1956387\",\"longitude\":\"72.8470145\",\"placeName\":\"Hindustan Petroleum Corporation Limited\",\"highlightType\":\"Petrol Pump\"},{\"distance\":\"2.1\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.205425\",\"longitude\":\"72.828018\",\"placeName\":\"IndianOil Petrol Pump (Kandivali West)\",\"highlightType\":\"Petrol Pump\"},{\"distance\":\"2.6\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.19624289999999\",\"longitude\":\"72.8473222\",\"placeName\":\"IndianOil\",\"highlightType\":\"Petrol Pump\"},{\"distance\":\"3.2\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.185693\",\"longitude\":\"72.848461\",\"placeName\":\"Navkar Cng Cylinder Testing Company\",\"highlightType\":\"Petrol Pump\"},{\"distance\":\"1.2\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.1938536\",\"longitude\":\"72.83314589999999\",\"placeName\":\"Ganpati Bappa Mandir\",\"highlightType\":\"Temple / Religious Places\"},{\"distance\":\"0.2\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.1935611\",\"longitude\":\"72.834058\",\"placeName\":\"Arshipada Mitra Mandal\",\"highlightType\":\"Temple / Religious Places\"},{\"distance\":\"0.2\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.1935397\",\"longitude\":\"72.8340711\",\"placeName\":\"Shree Mariamman Devasthanam\",\"highlightType\":\"Temple / Religious Places\"},{\"distance\":\"0.5\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.1930456\",\"longitude\":\"72.83078189999999\",\"placeName\":\"Shri Salasar Rokdiya Hanuman Mandir\",\"highlightType\":\"Temple / Religious Places\"},{\"distance\":\"0.5\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.1928472\",\"longitude\":\"72.8307323\",\"placeName\":\"Pippleshwar Mahadev Shiv Temple\",\"highlightType\":\"Temple / Religious Places\"},{\"distance\":\"0.4\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.1948605\",\"longitude\":\"72.83352839999999\",\"placeName\":\"Punjab National Bank - ATM\",\"highlightType\":\"ATM\"},{\"distance\":\"0.7\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.191924\",\"longitude\":\"72.832013\",\"placeName\":\"ICICI BANK ATM\",\"highlightType\":\"ATM\"},{\"distance\":\"0.9\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.1918641\",\"longitude\":\"72.83458499999999\",\"placeName\":\"Standard Chartered Mumbai Branch - Malad\",\"highlightType\":\"ATM\"},{\"distance\":\"0.3\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.1914023\",\"longitude\":\"72.83398500000001\",\"placeName\":\"Axis Bank ATM\",\"highlightType\":\"ATM\"},{\"distance\":\"0.4\",\"isCustom\":false,\"latitude\":\"19.1953621\",\"longitude\":\"72.83336179999999\",\"placeName\":\"Jana Small Finance Bank ATM\",\"highlightType\":\"ATM\"}],\"towersNum\":1,\"description\":\"Ruparel Stardom is an iconic luxury residential development located in Malad West, Mumbai, offering thoughtfully designed 2 and 3 BHK residences within a premium gated community. Spread across approximately 3.7 acres, the project comprises four elegant towers rising up to 49 storeys, featuring spacious homes with private decks and contemporary interiors. Strategically situated off Link Road, the development enjoys excellent connectivity to the Western Express Highway, Malad Metro Station, Malad Railway Station, SV Road, and major business hubs including Mindspace and Goregaon. Residents are surrounded by renowned schools, healthcare centres, shopping destinations, and entertainment hubs. The project features over 40 world-class lifestyle amenities, including a grand clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, landscaped gardens, children's play area, indoor games, jogging track, multipurpose hall, sports courts, sky leisure spaces, and advanced multi-tier security, delivering an elevated urban lifestyle.\",\"projectArea\":11502.1,\"projectAreaUnit\":\"SQM\",\"views\":636,\"isOwner\":false,\"approvalStatus\":\"APPROVED\",\"isActive\":true,\"isDisabled\":false,\"disabledAt\":null,\"disabledById\":null,\"risingStars\":false,\"metaData\":{\"lift\":true,\"steps\":{\"phases\":true,\"towers\":true,\"variants\":true,\"configurations\":true},\"parking\":true,\"pendingReraIds\":[\"P51800055521\"],\"brochureManifest\":{\"pages\":[{\"n\":1,\"full\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmhite4f5005esa1pydf7quza/v1/page_1_full.webp\"},{\"n\":2,\"full\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmhite4f5005esa1pydf7quza/v1/page_2_full.webp\"},{\"n\":3,\"full\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmhite4f5005esa1pydf7quza/v1/page_3_full.webp\"},{\"n\":4,\"full\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmhite4f5005esa1pydf7quza/v1/page_4_full.webp\"},{\"n\":5,\"full\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmhite4f5005esa1pydf7quza/v1/page_5_full.webp\"},{\"n\":6,\"full\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmhite4f5005esa1pydf7quza/v1/page_6_full.webp\"},{\"n\":7,\"full\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmhite4f5005esa1pydf7quza/v1/page_7_full.webp\"},{\"n\":8,\"full\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmhite4f5005esa1pydf7quza/v1/page_8_full.webp\"},{\"n\":9,\"full\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmhite4f5005esa1pydf7quza/v1/page_9_full.webp\"},{\"n\":10,\"full\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmhite4f5005esa1pydf7quza/v1/page_10_full.webp\"},{\"n\":11,\"full\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmhite4f5005esa1pydf7quza/v1/page_11_full.webp\"},{\"n\":12,\"full\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmhite4f5005esa1pydf7quza/v1/page_12_full.webp\"}],\"status\":\"ready\",\"version\":1,\"numPages\":12,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-31T18:29:05.286Z\"},\"constructionStatus\":\"UNDER_CONSTRUCTION\"},\"logoBg\":\"#fff2e9\",\"displayContact\":false,\"isAuthorizedByBuilder\":false,\"projectStory\